#~ msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
#~ msgid ""
#~ "This analysis performs a Cox proportional hazards regression, a "
#~ "statistical method used in survival analysis to examine the relationship "
#~ "between the time until an event occurs (such as death or failure) and one "
#~ "or more predictor variables. It helps you understand how different "
#~ "factors influence the risk or hazard of the event happening at any given "
#~ "time. The Cox model is particularly useful because it can handle censored "
#~ "data (when the event has not occurred for some subjects during the study "
#~ "period) and does not require assumptions about the baseline hazard "
#~ "function."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "本分析执行 Cox 比例风险回归，这是一种用于生存分析的统计方法，用于考察事件"
#~ "发生前的时间（如死亡或失败）与一个或多个预测变量之间的关系。它帮助您理解不"
#~ "同因素如何影响事件在任何给定时间发生的风险或风险率。Cox 模型尤其适用于处理"
#~ "删失数据（研究期间某些受试者尚未发生事件），并且不要求对基线风险函数作出假"
#~ "设。"

